the same change, three ways

starting from   {id: 5, item: laptop, qty: 1, memo: urgent}

PUT   {id: 5, item: laptop, qty: 2, memo: urgent}
      send the whole thing, and memo survives because you sent it

PUT   {id: 5, qty: 2}
      send the whole thing, and item and memo are now gone

PATCH {qty: 2}
      send only the change, and everything else is untouched
